WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:04.993
<v Maya>Thanks for joining. This is the weekly order review for October the ninth.

2
00:00:05.593 --> 00:00:11.761
<v Leo>Orders are up twelve percent to four thousand two hundred this week, but returns also rose to six percent.

3
00:00:12.361 --> 00:00:16.125
<v Maya>What is driving the returns? Is it sizing on the new jacket line?

4
00:00:16.725 --> 00:00:22.509
<v Leo>Yes. Sizing accounts for roughly two thirds of them, mostly the medium and large jackets.

5
00:00:23.109 --> 00:00:29.372
<v Maya>Okay. Leo, please update the size chart on the product pages by Tuesday, October thirteenth.

6
00:00:29.972 --> 00:00:35.953
<v Leo>Will do. I will also email the three hundred customers who returned a jacket with a ten percent voucher.

7
00:00:36.553 --> 00:00:41.458
<v Maya>Good. I will approve the voucher budget of three thousand rupees today. Anything else?

8
00:00:42.058 --> 00:00:47.761
<v Leo>One risk. The courier contract renews on October thirty first and their price goes up eight percent.

9
00:00:48.361 --> 00:00:53.625
<v Maya>Let us get two alternative quotes before then. I will take that one. Thanks everyone.
